WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.286
The message you type to an AI assistant is called a prompt. Clear prompts get better answers.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:12.856
First, the task: say exactly what you want, like explain, write or list.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:19.553
Second, context: who you are, and where. For example, a teacher in Gbarnga, Liberia.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:26.048
Third, details: simple English, or under one hundred and fifty words.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.458
Fourth, the format: bullet points, a table, or a short letter.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:37.200
The first answer is only a start. Ask it to shorten, explain again, or give an example.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:42.850
And never type passwords, PINs or ID numbers into an AI tool.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:54.255
Before you move on, check: Write a prompt with task, context, details and format. Ask one follow-up question. Keep private details out of prompts.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.206
In the next lesson: Checking AI answers.
